flowchart TB
    accTitle: The pictures of a visual change
    accDescr: The maintainer or a bot pushes to a pull request that changes how something looks, and its visual check renders the pictures again and keeps each one that looks different in an artifact, before and after, with its report, which says of each whether the eye sees its change. When the check passed, the pager asks GitHub for the pull request, with a token of its app. One of someone else, from a fork, that moved on to a newer head, or of a bot that merges by itself ends there, and so does a head whose pictures went already. Otherwise the pager reads the artifact with the same token, through the short-lived address of its storage. When every picture looks as committed, nothing comes. When the eye sees none of the changes, one quiet line comes, with how many pictures differ and by how much at most. When it sees some, their message goes into the topic of its release, or of a thing of their own, and the album of the three largest changes that the eye sees follows, each as one comparison of the same frame before and after with the changes framed in red, once per pull request: a newer head edits the message in place. The merge or the end of the pull request ticks the topic off.

    push["`The maintainer or a bot pushes to a pull request that changes how something looks`"]
    check["`The visual check renders the pictures and keeps each one that looks different, before and after, and says whether the eye sees its change`"]
    ask["The pager asks GitHub for the pull request, with a token of its app"]
    stop["`Someone else's, from a fork, a newer head, a bot's that merges by itself, or a head whose pictures went: nothing comes`"]
    read["`The pager reads the artifact, through the short-lived address of its storage`"]
    same["`Every picture looks as committed: nothing comes`"]
    unseen["`**🖼** Nobody sees the changes: one quiet line, with how many and by how much at most`"]
    topic["`**🖼** Their message in the topic of its release, or in one of their own, which a newer head edits in place`"]
    album["`**📸** One album per pull request: the three largest changes that the eye sees, each as one comparison of one frame before and after, the changes framed in red`"]
    done["`**✅** The merge or the end of the pull request ticks the topic off`"]

    push --> check
    check -- "passed" --> ask
    ask -- "not the pull request's pictures to show" --> stop
    ask -- "of the maintainer, or a bot that waits for him, at its head" --> read
    read -- "nothing changed" --> same
    read -- "the eye sees none of the changes" --> unseen --> done
    read -- "the eye sees a change" --> topic --> album --> done

    classDef you fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class push you
    class check,ask,stop,read,same bot
    class unseen,topic,album,done done
